∇ RawTests file;t;name;f0
 ⍝ Raw pastes have no expected files: compare with the reference model directly.
  f0←Failed
  t←ReadRaw file
  name←⊃⌽'/'(≠⊆⊢)file
  (name,': parse matches reference model')({(RefDump ⍵)Diff Dump ⍵}Check)t
  (name,': meeting dates and times match reference model')({(When Lines RefEvents ⍵)Diff When Events Ics ⍵}Check)t
  (name,': meeting summaries and descriptions match reference model')({(Lines RefEvents ⍵)Diff Events Ics ⍵}Check)t
  Variations name t
  :If f0=Failed ⋄ Say'  ok ',name ⋄ :EndIf
∇
